    "description": "Asahi Printing Co.,Ltd. engages in the manufacturing and sale of printed packaging materials and systems in Japan. The company operates through; Printing and Packaging Materials Business, and Packaging Systems Sales Business segments. It offers printed packing for the pharmaceutical and cosmetics sectors, such as packaging, labels and seals, instruction leaflets and related materials, and systems solutions. The company also offers blister and sachet packing machines; powder, pouch, tube, liquid bottle, and tablet counting and filling machines; and capping machines. In addition, it provides PTP stacking and banding systems, pillow packaging, cartoning and sealing, labeling, palletizing, corrugated box packing, film packaging, bundling, and shrink film packaging machines. Further, the company engages in temporary staffing business. Asahi Printing Co.,Ltd. was founded in 1872 and is headquartered in Toyama, Japan."
